---
import RootLayout from "~/layouts/RootLayout.astro";

const metadata = {
  title: "Privacy & POPIA — DeeMusiq",
  description:
    "DeeMusiq's privacy stance: what data we collect (account, device id, payment metadata), how we comply with South Africa's POPIA, and how to export or delete your data self-serve.",
  keywords:
    "DeeMusiq privacy, POPIA compliance, music app data privacy, South Africa data protection, export delete account data",
};
---

<RootLayout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="p-4 md:p-16 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="h1">Privacy &amp; POPIA</h1>
    <br />
    <p class="text-surface-500">
      DeeMusiq is a South African app, and we treat South Africa's Protection
      of Personal Information Act (POPIA) as the floor, not the ceiling. This
      page explains what we collect, why, and how you stay in control.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <h2 class="h2">What we collect</h2>
    <br />
    <p>We keep data collection narrow — only what the app needs to work:</p>
    <br />
    <ul class="list-disc ps-6 flex flex-col gap-2">
      <li>
        <strong>Account details</strong> — the basics needed to sign you in
        and keep your library and wallet in sync across devices.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Device identifier</strong> — used to protect your account,
        secure offline downloads, and spot abuse like account sharing or
        fraud.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Payment metadata</strong> — transaction records for wallet
        top-ups and
        <a href="/artist-payouts" class="underline">artist payouts</a> (amounts,
        timestamps, references). Card and banking details are handled by the
        payment provider, not stored by us.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <br />
    <p>
      We don't sell your data, and we don't build advertising profiles from
      your listening.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h2 class="h2">POPIA compliance posture</h2>
    <br />
    <p>
      As a South African service we process personal information in line with
      POPIA: lawful, minimal, and purpose-bound. Data is collected for the
      specific reasons above, kept only as long as it's needed, and protected
      with appropriate technical and organisational safeguards. You have the
      right to know what we hold about you, correct it, and object to
      processing.
    </p>
    <br />

    <h2 class="h2">Export and delete, self-serve</h2>
    <br />
    <p>
      Your data is yours. From inside the app you can export a copy of your
      account data or delete your account entirely — no support tickets, no
      dark patterns. Deleting your account removes your personal information
      from our systems, subject only to records we're legally required to keep
      (such as payment audit trails).
    </p>
    <br />

    <h2 class="h2">Open by default</h2>
    <br />
    <p>
      DeeMusiq is built on the open-source
      <a href="/spotube-alternative" class="underline">Spotube project</a>, so
      our approach to your device and your data can be inspected, not just
      trusted. Questions about privacy? Reach us via
      <a href="https://deemusiq.co.za" target="_blank" class="underline">deemusiq.co.za</a>.
    </p>
    <br /><br />

    <a href="/downloads" class="btn preset-filled-primary-300-700">
      Download DeeMusiq
    </a>
  </section>
</RootLayout>
